---
permalink: "/api/race.json"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
  Every site that has a stored filmstrip, as the /race/ page needs it.

  Built as its own document rather than inlined into the page because the
  selection is a query parameter: the page is one static file for every pairing,
  so the catalog has to be fetched rather than rendered.
-#}
{%- set racers = [] -%}
{%- for entry in sites.entries -%}
	{%- if entry.filmstrip and entry.filmstrip.frames.length and entry.latest -%}
		{%- set racers = (racers.push({
			slug: entry.slug,
			name: entry.displayUrl,
			groups: entry.groups,
			width: entry.filmstrip.width,
			height: entry.filmstrip.height,
			distinct: entry.filmstrip.distinct,
			settledAt: entry.filmstrip.settledAt,
			bands: entry | ringBands,
			scores: [
				entry.latest.lab.scores.performance,
				entry.latest.lab.scores.accessibility,
				entry.latest.lab.scores["best-practices"],
				entry.latest.lab.scores.seo
			],
			frames: entry.filmstrip.frames
		}), racers) -%}
	{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{#
  The categories Shuffle is allowed to draw from, and the ones its category
  select lists — one set, so the menu cannot offer something the pool refuses.

  Two existing flags, neither restated here. `excludeFromPerfectScores` keeps out
  the maintainer's own pages and the starter templates, whose near-empty demo
  pages score well by construction — the same reasoning the home page's Perfect
  Scores board uses, and it holds for an unprompted pairing too.
  `showOnHomePageCategoryList` keeps out the categories the front page does not
  put in front of anyone.

  Everything else stays reachable by typing it or linking to it — this only
  narrows what a random pairing offers on its own.
-#}
{%- set shuffleGroups = [] -%}
{%- for g in sites.groups -%}
	{%- if g.showOnHomePageCategoryList and not g.excludeFromPerfectScores -%}
		{%- set shuffleGroups = (shuffleGroups.push({ id: g.id, name: g.name }), shuffleGroups) -%}
	{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ {
	version: 1,
	formFactor: sites.config.formFactor,
	scoreLabels: [ "Performance", "Accessibility", "Best Practices", "SEO" ],
	categories: shuffleGroups,
	sites: racers
} | dump | safe }}
